      "message": "Does this help performance? (in images with significant zero-alpha portions)\n\n```\n    uint32_t color \u003d (uint32_t)a \u003c\u003c 24;\n    if (a !\u003d 0) {\n        const float invA \u003d 255.0f / a;\n        auto unpremul \u003d [invA](float c) {\n            return (uint32_t)std::round(c * invA);\n        };\n        color |\u003d unpremul(b) \u003c\u003c 16\n               | unpremul(g) \u003c\u003c  8\n               | unpremul(r) \u003c\u003c  0;\n    }\n    dst[i] \u003d color;\n```",
